{
  "_description": "ISCA'27 v3 ablation: Complete with M1 allocation = shared (one pool of W = 64 slots, no per-destination credits). Everything else as v3_complete.json. Both tables keep 64 entries (t18-window 64, table = 2W = 128 slots, -t18-req-entries/-t18-owner-entries unset). Old m2 filter dedup off (-remote-data-path-dedup-enable=false). Extends mi200.json (unchanged); -magic-memory-copy comes from mi200.json/hpca.json. P16 config #8.",
